{
  "info": {
    "name": "Staff Queue Overhaul (Advance Rights, Payment Stage, Assigned Filter)",
    "description": "Verifies: (1) Groomer/Pet Assistant now pass the Hotel/Daycare role gate (previously 403) via GET /hotel/stays, GET /daycare/sessions, and POST /hotel/check-in, POST /daycare/check-in (minimal/invalid bodies are fine here - the point is confirming the role gate no longer rejects them with 403, a 400 from body validation is an acceptable/expected outcome); (2) the new payment_stage track - POST /bookings/:id/payment-stage/advance requires `choice` only when currently Unpaid, moves Paid in Advance -> Paid with no choice, 409s once already Paid, and is gated to money-handling roles; PATCH /bookings/:id/payment-stage is Admin/Superadmin-only; (3) GET /bookings?assigned_staff_id=... filters by exact match or the 'unassigned' sentinel. Fill in groomer_identifier/groomer_password, admin_identifier/admin_password, cashier_identifier/cashier_password, receptionist_identifier/receptionist_password before running. Fill hotel_booking_id/daycare_booking_id with any Hotel/Daycare booking id (Supabase SQL Editor: `select id, service_category from public.bookings where service_category in ('Hotel','Daycare') limit 5;`). Fill payment_stage_booking_id with a Pending/In Progress booking currently Unpaid (fresh booking, or `update public.bookings set payment_stage = 'Unpaid' where id = '...';`). Run requests in order, top to bottom.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:3000" },
    { "key": "groomer_identifier", "value": "" },
    { "key": "groomer_password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "groomer_access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "groomer_staff_id", "value": "" },
    { "key": "admin_identifier", "value": "" },
    { "key": "admin_password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "admin_access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "cashier_identifier", "value": "" },
    { "key": "cashier_password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "cashier_access_token", "value": "" },
    { "key": "receptionist_identifier", "value": "" },
    { "key": "receptionist_password", "value": "" },
    { "key": "receptionist_access_token", "value": "" },
    {
      "key": "hotel_booking_id",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Any Hotel-category booking id"
    },
    {
      "key": "daycare_booking_id",
      "value": "",
      "description": "Any Daycare-category booking id"
    },
    {
      "key": "payment_stage_booking_id",
      "value": "",
      "description": "A Pending/In Progress booking currently payment_stage = Unpaid"
    },
    {
      "key": "paid_booking_id",
      "value": "",
      "description": "A booking already at payment_stage = Paid (for the 409 check)"
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "1. Login as Groomer",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"{{groomer_identifier}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{groomer_password}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/staff/login",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "staff", "login"]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
              "pm.test('login returns 200', function () { pm.response.to.have.status(200); });",
              "if (pm.response.code === 200) { pm.collectionVariables.set('groomer_access_token', pm.response.json().access_token); }"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "2. Login as Admin",
      "request": {
        "method": "POST",
        "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
        "body": {
          "mode": "raw",
          "raw": "{\n  \"identifier\": \"{{admin_identifier}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{admin_password}}\"\n}"
        },
        "url": {
          "raw": "{{base_url}}/auth/staff/login",
          "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
          "path": ["auth", "staff", "login"]
        }
      },
      "event": [
        {
          "listen": "test",
          "script": {
            "type": "text/javascript",
            "exec": [
